{
    "title": "State Farm\u00ae",
    "description": "With the award-winning State Farm\u00ae app, you can manage your insurance and other products, request roadside assistance, file and track claims, and much more.\r\n\r\nComing soon \u2013 Drive Safe & Save\u00ae\r\n\u2022\tDrive Safe & Save, our safe driving discount program, will be moving into the State Farm app soon.\r\n\u2022\tIf you're already using the Drive Safe & Save app, you won't lose any of your info. We'll add all of it to the State Farm app for you.\r\n\u2022\tYou can keep using the Drive Safe & Save app as usual if you already have it. We'll let you know when your Drive Safe & Save info has been added to the State Farm app.\r\n\r\nNote: To enroll in Drive Safe & Save, you must have at least one eligible vehicle insured by State Farm in a state where the program is available.\r\n\r\nView and manage your insurance policies.\r\n\u2022\tQuickly pay your insurance bill - even with Google Pay\r\n\u2022\tView your auto insurance ID card and add it to G-Pay\r\n\u2022\tView your insurance policies and coverage details\r\n\r\nHere to help when you have a claim.  \r\n\u2022\tFile a vehicle, property or vehicle glass claim\r\n\u2022\tTrack the status of your claim\r\n\u2022\tGet assistance with tire changes, dead batteries, stuck vehicles and more\r\n\u2022\tSearch for repair facilities\r\n\r\nBut wait, there\u2019s more!\r\n\u2022\tView details of your investment products\r\n\u2022\tPersonalized reminders and notifications when you login\r\n\u2022\tFAQs available in the app when you need them\r\n\u2022\tLearn about our other products",
    "descriptionHTML": "With the award-winning State Farm\u00ae app, you can manage your insurance and other products, request roadside assistance, file and track claims, and much more.<br><br>Coming soon \u2013 Drive Safe &amp; Save\u00ae<br>\u2022\tDrive Safe &amp; Save, our safe driving discount program, will be moving into the State Farm app soon.<br>\u2022\tIf you&#39;re already using the Drive Safe &amp; Save app, you won&#39;t lose any of your info. We&#39;ll add all of it to the State Farm app for you.<br>\u2022\tYou can keep using the Drive Safe &amp; Save app as usual if you already have it. We&#39;ll let you know when your Drive Safe &amp; Save info has been added to the State Farm app.<br><br>Note: To enroll in Drive Safe &amp; Save, you must have at least one eligible vehicle insured by State Farm in a state where the program is available.<br><br>View and manage your insurance policies.<br>\u2022\tQuickly pay your insurance bill - even with Google Pay<br>\u2022\tView your auto insurance ID card and add it to G-Pay<br>\u2022\tView your insurance policies and coverage details<br><br>Here to help when you have a claim.  <br>\u2022\tFile a vehicle, property or vehicle glass claim<br>\u2022\tTrack the status of your claim<br>\u2022\tGet assistance with tire changes, dead batteries, stuck vehicles and more<br>\u2022\tSearch for repair facilities<br><br>But wait, there\u2019s more!<br>\u2022\tView details of your investment products<br>\u2022\tPersonalized reminders and notifications when you login<br>\u2022\tFAQs available in the app when you need them<br>\u2022\tLearn about our other products",
